        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ONLINE SAFETY COMMITTEE Establishment of Committee"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "III",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_15",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_16",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_19",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DUTIES OF LICENSED APPLICATIONS SERVICE PROVIDER AND LICENSED CONTENT APPLICATIONS SERVICE PROVIDER Duty to implement measures to mitigate risk of exposure to harmful content"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall implement the measures as specified in the code to mitigate the risk of users being exposed to harmful content."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding subsection (1), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider may implement any alternative measures other than the measures specified in the code if the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider proves to the satisfaction of the Commission that the alternative measures will better mitigate the risk of users being exposed to harmful content."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The measures implemented under this section shall not unreasonably or disproportionately limit a user’s expression. Duty to issue guidelines to user"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall issue guidelines to users which shall include—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a description of measures implemented by the licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider under section 13; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "terms of use as a guide to users when using the service of the licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall make available on their services the guidelines issued under subsection (1) and ensure that the guidelines are clear, easily accessible and understood, and regularly updated. Duty to enable user to manage online safety"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall make available on their services sufficient tools and settings to enable users to manage their online safety."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The tools and settings referred to in subsection (1) shall include the tools for the users to prevent or limit other users from identifying, locating or communicating with them on the service of the licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider. Duty to make available mechanism for reporting harmful content"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall make available on their services a mechanism that enable users to make a report to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider regarding any content that the users believe is a harmful content available on the service of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider. Duty to make available mechanism for user assistance"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall make available on their services a mechanism for user assistance which is easily accessible to all types of users and responsive at all times."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The mechanism for user assistance referred to in subsection (1) shall be, among others, for the following purposes:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "for the users to raise their concerns with respect to online safety, including measures implemented by the licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider under section 13;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "for the users to obtain any other information on the mechanisms with respect to online safety available on the service of the licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider within the period as may be prescribed; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "for the users to make any inquiry. Duty to protect online safety of child user"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall implement the measures as specified in the code to ensure safe use of their services by child users."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding subsection (1), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider may implement any alternative measures other than the measures specified in the code if the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider proves to the satisfaction of the Commission that the alternative measures will better ensure safe use of its service by child users."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The measures implemented under this section shall include measures to ensure safe design and operation of the service that is, in the opinion of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider, likely to be accessed by child users—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prevent access of a user identified to be a child to a content suspected to be a harmful content;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to limit the ability of a user identified to be an adult from communicating with a user identified to be a child;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to limit features that increase, sustain or extend the use of its service by a user identified to be a child;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prevent a user identified to be an adult from viewing the personal information of a user identified to be a child that is available on its service; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to control personalized recommendation systems suitable for child users. Duty to establish mechanism for making priority harmful content inaccessible"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall establish a mechanism for making priority harmful content available on their services inaccessible to all users. Duty to prepare Online Safety Plan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_5"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall prepare an Online Safety Plan on their compliance of the duties under this Part."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Online Safety Plan referred to in subsection (1) shall be prepared within the period and in such form and contain the information, as may be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider shall make available on their services the Online Safety Plan prepared under subsection (1) and ensure that the Online Safety Plan is easily accessible and regularly updated."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Online Safety Plan prepared and made available under this section shall not contain any personal information of any user."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_III__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A copy of the Online Safety Plan prepared under subsection (1) shall be submitted to the Commission."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Committee shall have the functions to advise and give recommendations to the Commission on matters relating to online safety including—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the determination of types of harmful content;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the determination of priority harmful content;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "methods to analyze and measures to mitigate, the risk of users being exposed to harmful content;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "research approach pertaining to harmful content; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "best practices to encourage accountability of the licensed applications service provider, licensed content applications service provider and licensed network service provider."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Committee shall have all such powers as may be necessary for, or in connection with, or reasonably incidental to, the performance of its functions under this Act. Meetings of Committee"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_6"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Committee shall convene its meeting as often as the Chairman may determine and the meeting shall be held at the time and place as determined by the Chairman."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Chairman shall preside at all meetings of the Committee."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If the Chairman is absent from any meeting of the Committee, he may direct the Deputy Chairman to replace him as the chairman of the meeting."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The quorum of the Committee shall be seven and shall consist of at least one member appointed under paragraph 5(2)(j) and one member appointed under paragraph 5(2)(l)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Chairman may authorize the use of a live video link, live television link or any other electronic means of communication for the purposes of any meeting of the Committee."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Committee may determine its own procedure. Committee may invite others to attend meetings"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Committee may invite any person to attend meetings of the Committee to provide opinion to the Committee on any matter under discussion."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_6"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A committee by the name of “Online Safety Committee” is established."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_g",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_h",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_j",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_k",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_l"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Committee shall consist of the following members:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a Chairman and Deputy Chairman;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "one representative from the Ministry charged with the responsibility for communications;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "one representative from the Ministry charged with the responsibility for home affairs;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "one representative from the Ministry charged with the responsibility for digital related matters;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "one representative from the Ministry charged with the responsibility for education;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "one representative from the Ministry charged with the responsibility for women, family and community development;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "one representative from the Royal Malaysia Police;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_h",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "h",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "one representative from the National Security Council;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_i",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Chief Children Commissioner or his representative from amongst the Children Commissioners;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_j",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "j",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "one representative each from amongst the licensed applications service providers, licensed content applications service providers and licensed network service providers;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_k",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "k",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "one representative from amongst persons with disabilities; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2__para_l",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "l",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "not more than five persons with appropriate experience, knowledge or expertise in matters relating to online safety."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The members of the Committee referred to in paragraphs (2)(a), (j), (k) and (l) shall be appointed by the Minister."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The members of the Committee appointed under paragraphs (2)(a), (j), (k) and (l) shall hold office for a term not exceeding three years and shall be eligible for reappointment upon expiry of their term of office for a term not exceeding three years."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of paragraph (2)(i), the “Chief Children Commissioner” and “Children Commissioner” mean the Chief Children Commissioner and the Children Commissioner designated under section 6a of the Human Rights Commission of Malaysia Act 1999 [Act 597]."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this Part, “Minister” means the Minister charged with the responsibility for law. Allowances for members of Committee"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The members of the Committee shall be paid such allowances as the Minister may determine after consultation with the Minister of Finance. Revocation of appointment and resignation of members of Committee"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may at any appointment of any member of the Committee referred to in paragraphs 5(2)(a), (j), (k) and (l) without assigning any reason."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A member of the Committee referred to in paragraphs 5(2)(a), (j), (k) and (l) may, at any time, resign from his appointment by giving a notice in writing to the Minister. Vacation of office of members of Committee"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_g",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_h",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_i"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The office of a member of the Committee referred to in paragraphs 5(2)(a), (j), (k) and (l) shall be vacated—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if he dies;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if there has been proved against him, or he has been convicted on, a charge in respect of—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "an offence involving fraud, dishonesty or moral turpitude;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "an offence under any law relating to corruption; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any other offence punishable with imprisonment, whether in itself only or in addition to or in lieu of a fine, for more than two years;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if his conduct, whether in connection with his duties as a member of the Committee or otherwise, has been such as to bring discredit on the Committee;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if he becomes a bankrupt or insolvent;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if he becomes of unsound mind or is otherwise incapable of discharging his duties;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of the Chairman, if he absents himself from three consecutive meetings of the Committee without leave in writing of the Minister;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a member of the Committee other than the Chairman, if he absents himself from three consecutive meetings of the Committee without leave in writing of the Chairman;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_h",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "h",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if his appointment has been revoked by the Minister; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__para_i",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if his resignation has been accepted by the Minister. Temporary exercise of functions of Chairman"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_II__cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
