      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A user may make a report to a licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider regarding any content which he believes is a harmful content available on the service of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider in such form and manner as may be determined by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon receipt of the report made under subsection (1), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall within the period as may be prescribed—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "acknowledge receipt of the report;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "notify in writing the status of the report to the user who made the report; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "assess the report."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon assessment of the report made under subsection (1), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall dismiss the report if the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is of the opinion that the report is frivolous, vexatious or not made in good faith or the subject matter of the report is trivial; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "determines that the subject matter of the report is or has already been the subject matter of another report made to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the report is dismissed under subsection (3), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall notify in writing the user who made the report of such dismissal."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The user who is aggrieved by the dismissal of the report under subsection (3) may, by request to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider, inquire into the dismissal from the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider within the period as may be prescribed and give reasons as to why his report should not be dismissed by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon receipt of the inquiry together with the reasons from the aggrieved user under subsection (5), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider may review its decision made under subsection (3) and decide whether the dismissal should be maintained or further action should be taken under section 22 or 23."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any decision of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider made under subsection (6) in respect of the inquiry shall be notified in writing to the aggrieved user within the period as may be prescribed. Report to licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider on priority harmful content"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_7"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the report made by a user under subsection 21(1) is not dismissed under subsection 21(3) or (6) and the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider is of the opinion that the content being the subject matter of the report is a priority harmful content, the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall immediately make the content inaccessible on its service to all users for a period as may be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Before the period referred to in subsection (1) expires, the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall determine on reasonable grounds if the content made inaccessible on its service under subsection (1) is a priority harmful content."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider determines under subsection (2) that the content made inaccessible on its service under subsection (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is a priority harmful content, the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall, within the period as may be prescribed, make the priority harmful content be permanently inaccessible on its service to all users; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is not a priority harmful content, the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider may, within the period as may be prescribed, make the content accessible again on its service to all users."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any action taken by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider under this section shall be notified in writing to the user who made the report regarding the content and the user who communicated the content on the service of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The user who is aggrieved by the action taken by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider under this section may, by request to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider, inquire into such action from the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider within the period as may be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon receipt of the inquiry from the aggrieved user under subsection (5), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider may review its decision on the action taken in relation to the inquiry."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any decision of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider made under subsection (6) in respect of the inquiry shall be notified in writing to the aggrieved user within the period as may be prescribed. Report to licensed applications service provider and licensed content applications service provider on harmful content"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_8",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_9"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the report made by a user under subsection 21(1) is not dismissed under subsection 21(3) or (6) and the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider is of the opinion that the content being the subject matter of the report is a harmful content, the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider may make the content inaccessible on its service to all users within and for a period as may be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider makes the content inaccessible on its service for the period as prescribed under subsection (1), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall, before the period expires, determine on reasonable grounds if the content made inaccessible is a harmful content."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider determines under subsection (2) that the content made inaccessible on its service under subsection (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is a harmful content, the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall, within the period as may be prescribed, make the harmful content be permanently inaccessible on its service to all users; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is not a harmful content, the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall, within the period as may be prescribed, make the content accessible again on its service to all users."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any action taken by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider under this section shall be notified in writing to the user who made the report regarding the content and the user who communicated the content on the service of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The user who is aggrieved by the action taken by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider under this section may, by request to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider, inquire into such action from the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider within the period as may be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon receipt of the inquiry from the aggrieved user under subsection (5), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider may review its decision on the action taken in relation to the inquiry."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any decision of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider made under subsection (6) in respect of the inquiry shall be notified in writing to the aggrieved user within the period as may be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If it comes to the knowledge of the Commission that the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider has not made the content referred to in subsection (1) inaccessible on its service to all users, despite the determination made by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider under subsection (2) that the content is a harmful content, the Commission may, in the interest of the public, issue a written instruction to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider requiring the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider to make the content permanently inaccessible on its service within the period as specified in the written instruction."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_9",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider which fails to comply with a written instruction issued by the Commission under subsection (8) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one million ringgit and shall be liable to a further fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit for every day or part of a day during which the offence continues after conviction. Report to Commission"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_7"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A user may make a report to the Commission in such form and manner as may be determined by the Commission—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "regarding any content which he believes is a harmful content available on the service of a licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider regardless of whether a report has been made by him under section 21 to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider regarding the same content; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "regarding any content which he believes is a harmful content available online other than on the service of a licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon receipt of the report made under subsection (1), the Commission shall within the period as may be prescribed—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "acknowledge receipt of the report;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "notify in writing the status of the report to the user who made the report; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "assess the report."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon assessment of the report made under subsection (1), the Commission shall dismiss the report if the Commission—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is of the opinion that the report is frivolous, vexatious or not made in good faith or the subject matter of the report is trivial; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "determines that the subject matter of the report is or has already been the subject matter of another report made to the Commission."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the report is dismissed under subsection (3), the Commission shall notify in writing the user who made the report of such dismissal."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The user who is aggrieved by the dismissal of the report under subsection (3) may, by request to the Commission, inquire into the dismissal from the Commission within the period as may be prescribed and give reasons as to why his report should not be dismissed by the Commission."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon receipt of the inquiry together with the reasons from the aggrieved user under subsection (5), the Commission may review its decision made under subsection (3) and decide whether the dismissal should be maintained or further action should be taken under section 25."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any decision of the Commission made under subsection (6) in respect of the inquiry shall be notified in writing to the aggrieved user within the period as may be prescribed. Report to Commission on harmful content"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_5"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the report made by a user under subsection 24(1) is not dismissed under subsection 24(3) or (6) and the Commission determines on reasonable grounds that the content being the subject matter of the report is a harmful content including priority harmful content, the Commission shall—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the harmful content is available on the service of a licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider, issue a written instruction to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider requiring the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider to make the content permanently inaccessible on its service to all users within the period as may be specified in the written instruction; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the harmful content is available online other than on the service of a licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider, issue a written instruction to the relevant licensed network service provider requiring the licensed network service provider to restrict the relevant parts of its network service within the period as may be specified in the written instruction so as to make the content permanently inaccessible to all users."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any action taken by the licensed applications service provider, licensed content applications service provider or licensed network service provider pursuant to the written instruction under subsection (1) shall be notified in writing to the Commission and the Commission shall notify the same in writing to the user who made the report regarding the content."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider to which the written instruction was issued under subsection (1) shall notify in writing the user who communicated the content on its service of the action it has taken pursuant to the written instruction."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any licensed applications service provider, licensed content applications service provider or licensed network service provider which fails to comply with a written instruction issued by the Commission under subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one million ringgit and shall be liable to a further fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit for every day or part of a day during which the offence continues after conviction."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the Commission determines on reasonable grounds that the content being the subject matter of the report made under subsection 24(1) is not a harmful content, the Commission shall notify in writing the user who made the report of its determination. Action by licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider on its own motion"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_5"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider may, regardless of whether a report has been made by a user under section 21 or 24, on its own motion make any content inaccessible on its service in the manner as it may determine if the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider has reasonable grounds to believe that the content is a priority harmful content."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a content has been made inaccessible under subsection (1), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall notify in writing the user who communicated the content on its service."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The user aggrieved by the action taken by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider under subsection (1) may, by request to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider, inquire into such action from the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider within the period as may be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon receipt of the inquiry from the aggrieved user under subsection (3), the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider may review its decision on the action taken in relation to the inquiry."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any decision of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider made under subsection (4) in respect of the inquiry shall be notified to the aggrieved user within the period as may be prescribed. Commission may issue written instruction to make content accessible"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding any provision of this Act, if it comes to the knowledge of the Commission that the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider has made any content available on its service inaccessible, the Commission may, in the interest of the public, issue a written instruction to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider requiring the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider to make the content accessible again on its service to all users within the period as may be specified in the written instruction. Inconsistency between written instruction or determination of Commission and action by licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a user makes a report to a licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider under section 21 and at the same time makes a report to the Commission under section 24 regarding the same content which the user believes is a harmful content, and there is inconsistency between the action taken by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider under section 22 or section 23 and the written instruction issued by the Commission under subsection 25(1) or section 27 or the determination made by the Commission referred to in subsection 25(5) in respect of the report, the written instruction issued or the determination made by the Commission shall prevail. Notification to user on report to enforcement agency"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider makes a report to any enforcement agency in relation to a content being the subject matter of a report made by a user to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider under section 21, the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider shall not disclose to the user who made the report any information relating to the report made to the enforcement agency."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "IX",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_69",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_70",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_71",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_72",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_76",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_77",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_79",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_82",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_83",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MISCELLANEOUS Interworking with other authority"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_69",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "69",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may direct the Commission regarding the interworking arrangements between the Commission and any other authority in Malaysia or in a foreign jurisdiction, or between the Commission and any international organization. Judicial review"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_70",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "70",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_70__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_70__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_70__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_70",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A person who is aggrieved or whose interest is adversely affected by a decision or other action of the Minister or the Commission may apply to the High Court for a judicial review of such decision or other action."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_70__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_70",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A person shall not apply to the court for a judicial review unless that person has first exhausted all other remedies provided under this Act. Power to exempt"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_71",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "71",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, exempt, subject to such conditions as the Minister deems fit to impose, any licensed applications service provider, licensed content applications service provider or licensed network service provider or class of licensed applications service provider, licensed content applications service provider or licensed network service provider from all or any of the provisions of this Act. Prosecution"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_72",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "72",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No prosecution shall be instituted for an offence under this Act without the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor. Liability of director, etc., of company, etc."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "73",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any person who commits an offence under this Act is a company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons, a person who at the time of the commission of the offence was a director, compliance officer, partner, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons or was purporting to act in the capacity or was in any manner or to any extent responsible for the management of any of the affairs of the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons or was assisting in its management—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "may be charged severally or jointly in the same proceedings with the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons is found guilty of the offence, shall be deemed to be guilty of the offence and shall be liable to the same punishment or penalty as an individual unless, having regard to the nature of his functions in that capacity and to all circumstances, he proves—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the offence was committed without his knowledge; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_73__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the offence was committed without his consent or connivance and that he had taken all reasonable precautions and exercised due diligence to prevent the commission of the offence. Compounding of offence"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "74",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_6"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may, with the approval of the Public Prosecutor, make regulations prescribing—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any offence under this Act as an offence which may be compounded; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the method and procedure for compounding such offence."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Chairman of the Commission may, with the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor, compound any offence committed by any person under this Act prescribed to be a compoundable offence by making an offer in writing to the person suspected to have committed the offence to compound the offence upon payment to the Chairman of the Commission of an amount of money not exceeding fifty per centum of the amount of maximum fine for that offence within such time as may be specified in his offer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An offer under subsection (2) may be made at any time after the offence has been committed but before any prosecution for it has been instituted."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If the amount specified in the offer is not paid within the time specified in the offer, or such extended time as the Chairman of the Commission may grant, prosecution for the offence may be instituted at any time after that against the person to whom the offer was made."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where an offence has been compounded under this section—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "no prosecution shall be instituted in respect of the offence against the person to whom the offer to compound was made; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any document or thing seized in connection with the offence may be released by the Chairman of the Commission, subject to such terms as the Chairman of the Commission thinks fit."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_74",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All sums of money received by the Chairman of the Commission under this section shall be paid into and form part of the Federal Consolidated Fund. Obligation of secrecy"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "75",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except for the purposes of this Part or for the purposes of any civil or criminal proceedings under any written law or where authorized by the Minister—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Chairman of the Committee, any other member of the Committee, the Chairman of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal, any other member of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal, the Secretary to the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal or any officer of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal shall not, during the time he serves as such Chairman, member, Secretary or officer, disclose any information obtained by him in the course of his duties; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "no other person who has, by any means, access to any information or document relating to the affairs of the Committee or the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal shall disclose such information or document."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_75",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three months or to both. Public servant"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_76",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "76",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Chairman of the Committee, every other member of the Committee, the Chairman of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal, every other member of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal, the Secretary to the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal or any officer of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal while discharging his duties as the Chairman, member, secretary or officer, shall be deemed to be a public servant within the meaning of the Penal Code. Application of Public Authorities Protection Act 1948"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_77",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "77",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against the Committee, Online Safety Appeal Tribunal, the Chairman of the Committee, any other member of the Committee, the Chairman of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal, any other member of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal, the Secretary to the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal or any officer of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal in respect of any act, neglect or default done or committed by it or him in good faith or any omission by it or him in good faith in such capacity. Act or omission done in good faith"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "78",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No action or suit shall be instituted or maintained in any court against—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Committee or the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Chairman of the Committee or any other member of the Committee;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Chairman of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal or any other member of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Secretary to the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal or any other officer of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_78",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any person authorized to act for and on behalf of the Committee or the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal, for any act or omission done in good faith in the performance of its or his functions and in the exercise of its or his powers under this Act. Protection of officer and other person"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_79",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "79",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_79__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_79__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No action, suit or prosecution or other proceedings shall lie or be brought, instituted or maintained in any court against—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_79__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_79",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Commission or any authorized officer or any other person in respect of any act ordered or done for the purpose of carrying into effect this Act; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_79__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_79",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any other person in respect of any act done or purported to be done by him under the order, directions or instruction of the Commission or any authorized officer if the act was done in good faith and in a reasonable belief that it was necessary for the purpose intended to be served by it. Power to issue guidelines and code"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "80",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Commission may issue any guidelines as may be expedient or necessary for the better carrying out of the provisions of this Act and for the purpose of ensuring compliance with this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Without prejudice to subsection (1), the Commission may issue any code for the purposes of compliance of duties under Part III by the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every guidelines and code issued under this Act shall be published by the Commission in the manner as may be determined by the Commission."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_80",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Commission may revoke, vary, revise or amend the whole or any part of any guidelines or code issued under this Power to make regulations"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "81",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may make regulations as may be necessary or expedient for the purpose of carrying into effect the provisions of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_g",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_h",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_j"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Without prejudice to the generality of subsection (1), the Minister may make regulations—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe other characteristics of a private messaging feature of an applications service or content applications service;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the period for the users to obtain any other information on the mechanisms with respect to online safety available on the service of the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the period for the preparation of and form of the Online Safety Plan and the information to be contained in the Online Safety Plan;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the period for actions to be taken in respect of the report on harmful content made to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider or to the Commission;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the period for the users to make an inquiry in respect of a report on harmful content to the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider or to the Commission and for the notification of the decision in respect of the inquiry;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the period for the licensed applications service provider or licensed content applications service provider to make a priority harmful content or harmful content or any other content on its service inaccessible or accessible to users;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the fees payable under this Act, including any processing fees;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_h",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "h",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the form of undertaking provided to the Commission;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_iii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_iv",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_v"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to provide for matters relating to the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal including—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the period and manner for any appeal to the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal by a person who is aggrieved by the written instruction, determination, directions or decision issued or made by the Commission;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the procedures and the conduct of hearing of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the funding of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the procedures for the appointment of members of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal including the appointment of any person to act as any member of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i__subpara_v",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "v",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_i",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the employment of officers of the Online Safety Appeal Tribunal;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2__para_j",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "j",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to provide for any other matters required by this Act to be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_81",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any regulations made under this Act may prescribe an act or omission in contravention of the regulations to be an offence and may prescribe penalties of a fine not exceeding one million ringgit. Power to amend First Schedule and Second Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_82",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "82",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_82__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_82__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_82__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_82",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may, on the recommendation of the Commission, by order published in the Gazette, amend the First Schedule and the Second Schedule."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_82__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_82",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In giving the recommendation under subsection (1), the Commission shall consult the Committee. Power to specify form and manner of submission"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_83",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "83",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where under any provision of this Act any person is required to submit, produce or give to the Commission any information, records, particulars or documents, the Commission may specify that such information, records, particulars or documents shall be submitted, produced or given in such form and manner and within such period or at such intervals as the Commission may specify. Service or notification of written instruction, etc."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "84",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every written instruction, notice in writing, directions or any other document required by this Act to be served on or notified to any person may be served or notified—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "personally upon the person;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by sending it to the person by registered post; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by way of electronic transmission."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A written instruction, notice in writing, directions or other document sent to a person by registered post shall be deemed to have been served on or notified to that person at the time at which it would have been delivered to that person in the ordinary course of the post if the written instruction, notice in writing, directions or other document was addressed—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a company, a firm, a society, an association or other body of persons—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to its registered office;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to its last-known address; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to any person authorized by it to accept service of process; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of an individual, to his last-known address."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_IX__cl_84",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a person has given his consent for a written instruction, notice in writing, directions or other document to be served on or notified to him through the electronic service, the written instruction, notice in writing, directions or other document shall be deemed to have been served and notified at the time when the electronic notice is transmitted to his account through the electronic service."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Online Safety Act 2024."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Application"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subject to subsection (2), this Act shall apply to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any applications service which utilizes internet access service that enables communications between users;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any content applications service which utilizes internet access service to provide content; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any network service."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act shall not apply to a private messaging feature of any applications service and content applications service."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of subsection (2), “private messaging feature” means a feature that allows a user to communicate a content to a specific and limited number of recipients determined by the user and may contain any other characteristics as may be prescribed. Territorial and extra-territorial application"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act shall apply within and outside Malaysia."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding subsection (1), this Act shall apply to any person beyond the geographical limits of Malaysia and the territorial waters of Malaysia if such person provides any applications service, content applications service or network service in a place within Malaysia and is a licensee under the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998 [Act 588]."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section, “place” means a point of any nature or description whether on land, in the atmosphere, in outer space, underground, underwater, at sea or anywhere else."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section, a place that is—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in or below the stratosphere; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "above the geographical limits of Malaysia and her territorial waters, is taken to be a place within the geographical limits of Malaysia and her territorial waters. Interpretation"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires—"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“this Act” includes any subsidiary legislation made under this Act; “communications data” has the meaning assigned to it in the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998; “prescribed” means prescribed by the Minister by regulations made under this Act; “Committee” means the Online Safety Committee established under section 5; “child” means a person who is under the age of eighteen years; “content” has the meaning assigned to it in the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998; “harmful content” means any of the contents as specified in the First Schedule; “priority harmful content” means the harmful content as specified in the Second Schedule; “code” means a code issued by the Commission under section 80; “Minister” means the Minister charged with the responsibility for communications; “authorized officer” means any police officer, or any public officer or officer of the Commission authorized in writing by the Minister under section 52; “licensed applications service provider” means an applications service provider licensed under the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998; “licensed content applications service provider” means a content applications service provider licensed under the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998; “licensed network service provider” means a network service provider licensed under the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998; “user” means—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a user of the applications service provided by a licensed applications service provider; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_I__cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a user of the content applications service provided by a licensed content applications service provider; “applications service” has the meaning assigned to it in the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998; “content applications service” has the meaning assigned to it in the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998; “network service” has the meaning assigned to it in the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998; “communications system” has the meaning assigned to it in the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998; “Commission” means the Malaysian Communications and Multimedia Commission established under section 4 of the Malaysian Communications and Multimedia Commission Act 1998 [Act 589]."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_V",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "V",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_V__cl_30",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_V__cl_33",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_V__cl_34",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@/~part_V__cl_35"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/59/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "POWERS OF THE COMMISSION Power to issue directions"
      }
    },
    {
